meta {
  name: Download Application Resume
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/applications/{{application_id}}/resume
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  ## RS-031 — Download Resume API

  Downloads the PDF resume file for a candidate's application.

  ### Requirements & Features
  - Requires recruiter authentication (Bearer token).
  - Verifies the recruiter owns the job associated with this application.
  - Returns `404` if application not found, job not owned, or file missing in storage.
  - Returns `application/pdf` binary stream with `Content-Disposition: attachment`.

  ### Path Parameters
  | Param          | Type | Description                   |
  |----------------|------|-------------------------------|
  | application_id | UUID | UUID of the job application   |
}
